{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Project Signal,</i>\u00a0you are a nameless trekker searching for potential UFO evidence in a remote wilderness. If there is such knowledge to be found, said knowledge is dangerous to possess - and this is why you will not be alone in the wilderness. Strange men will come after you when you discover ''too much,'' intent on making you disappear forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are given a large wilderness to explore with many points of interest. In this semi-randomized area, various pieces of evidence and phenomenon can be found. Discovering evidence will bring you closer to victory, but also make the experience turn more dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have gathered enough evidence, you will receive visitors. Black-clad men are now after you, intent on making you disappear. Can you outrun them and escape the vast forest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >large, open 3D environment with points of interest and randomized elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >keep your ears open and hold a sharp sense of orientation - or lose yourself in the wilds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >three difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >post-game statistics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998980?t=1759990438","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998980?t=1759990438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998980/2995195553498a7cb08c462b1dff654bcf53f58a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759990438","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998980/2995195553498a7cb08c462b1dff654bcf53f58a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759990438","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Project Signal,</i>\u00a0you are a nameless trekker searching for potential UFO evidence in a remote wilderness. If there is such knowledge to be found, said knowledge is dangerous to possess - and this is why you will not be alone in the wilderness. Strange men will come after you when you discover ''too much,'' intent on making you disappear forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are given a large wilderness to explore with many points of interest. In this semi-randomized area, various pieces of evidence and phenomenon can be found. Discovering evidence will bring you closer to victory, but also make the experience turn more dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have gathered enough evidence, you will receive visitors. Black-clad men are now after you, intent on making you disappear. Can you outrun them and escape the vast forest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >large, open 3D environment with points of interest and randomized elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >keep your ears open and hold a sharp sense of orientation - or lose yourself in the wilds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >three difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >post-game statistics</p></li></ul>","developers":["AcroGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998980/9264b707c1b646fd1a6da20e8f686f000c9021f0/header.jpg?t=1759990438","is_free":false,"linux_requ